https://github.com/nicolas3d/SystemVerilog

## Modifications

The following modifications were made to adapt the plugin for VSCode:
1. Created extension.js to integrate with VSCode formatting API
2. Created python/formatter.py as a wrapper for the beautifier
3. Removed Sublime Text specific dependencies
4. Added configuration support through VSCode settings

All core formatting logic (verilog_beautifier.py, verilogutil.py) remains
unchanged from the original implementation.
